@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml

title L2：消息补齐与 messageId 类图
left to right direction

package "API Model\napi.model" #E3F2FD {
  class MessageEnvelope
  class MessageMetadata
  class MessageContext
}

package "Core Enrich\ncore.enrich" #EDE7F6 {
  class MessageEnvelopeEnricher
}

package "Core ID\ncore.id" #E0F2F1 {
  interface MessageIdGenerator
  class FoundationMessageIdGenerator
  class UuidMessageIdGenerator
}

package "Foundation" #E0F2F1 {
  class "Foundation IdGenerator\nexternal bean" as FoundationId
}

MessageEnvelopeEnricher --> MessageEnvelope
MessageEnvelopeEnricher --> MessageMetadata
MessageEnvelopeEnricher --> MessageContext
MessageEnvelopeEnricher --> MessageIdGenerator
FoundationMessageIdGenerator ..|> MessageIdGenerator
UuidMessageIdGenerator ..|> MessageIdGenerator
FoundationMessageIdGenerator --> FoundationId

note right of FoundationMessageIdGenerator
正式环境优先复用 foundation-id。
没有 foundation bean 时，demo 可退回 UUID。
end note
@enduml
